@startuml SEQ_01_Registration_Login
title Sequence 1 — User Registration & Login

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #888

actor       "Student / Household"   as User
participant "Mobile App"            as App
participant "AuthAPI\n/auth/"       as API
participant "CustomUser\nModel"     as CU
participant "StudentProfile\nModel" as SP
participant "HouseholdProfile\nModel" as HP
participant "RatingService"         as RS
database    "PostgreSQL"            as DB

== Student Registration ==

User  -> App   : Fill registration form\n(username, email, password,\nrole=STUDENT, university_id, …)
App   -> API   : POST /auth/register/\n{role, username, email, password, …}
API   -> API   : Validate payload\n(RegisterSerializer)

alt Validation fails
  API --> App  : 400 Bad Request\n{errors}
  App --> User : Show field errors
else Validation passes
  API   -> CU  : CustomUser.objects.create_user()\n(role=STUDENT)
  CU    -> DB  : INSERT INTO users_customuser
  DB   --> CU  : user saved (id=X)

  API   -> SP  : StudentProfile.objects.create(\n  user=user,\n  university_id=…,\n  verification_status=Pending\n)
  SP    -> DB  : INSERT INTO users_studentprofile
  DB   --> SP  : profile saved

  API   -> RS  : seed_initial_rating(user, score=5.0)
  RS    -> DB  : INSERT INTO payments_rating\n(score=5, system seed)
  DB   --> RS  : seed rating saved

  API  --> App : 201 Created\n{token, user_id, role}
  App  --> User : "Account created! Pending verification."
end

== Household Registration ==

User  -> App   : Fill form (role=HOUSEHOLD, address, …)
App   -> API   : POST /auth/register/\n{role=HOUSEHOLD, …}
API   -> CU    : CustomUser.objects.create_user()\n(role=HOUSEHOLD)
CU    -> DB    : INSERT INTO users_customuser
DB   --> CU    : saved

API   -> HP    : HouseholdProfile.objects.create(\n  user=user, address=…\n)
HP    -> DB    : INSERT INTO users_householdprofile
DB   --> HP    : saved

API  --> App   : 201 Created {token, user_id, role}
App  --> User  : "Account created!"

== Login (username or email) ==

User  -> App   : Enter credentials\n(username or email, password)
App   -> API   : POST /auth/login/\n{username_or_email, password}
API   -> API   : Normalize: detect email vs username
API   -> CU    : CustomUser.objects.get(\n  Q(username=…) | Q(email=…)\n)
CU    -> DB    : SELECT FROM users_customuser
DB   --> CU    : user record

alt User not found
  API --> App  : 401 Unauthorized\n{"detail": "Invalid credentials"}
  App --> User : "Invalid username/email or password"
else User found
  API   -> API : authenticate(password)
  alt Password wrong
    API --> App : 401 Unauthorized
    App --> User : "Invalid credentials"
  else Password correct
    API   -> API : Token.objects.get_or_create(user)
    API  --> App : 200 OK\n{token, user_id, role}
    App  --> User : Navigate to home screen
  end
end

@enduml
